\f1\fs22 The Pale City Council\'97which retained governance over all ground floors above the Layer, due to an emergency town hall, a matin\'e9e of the Fifty Shades of Grey trilogy, and a clerical error involving a safe word all happening on the same afternoon\'97the Pale City Council affixed a judgment notice to Hardy\'92s building, which is to say they had a graffiti artist tag the front windows of the tower, proclaiming the foyer no longer measured up to municipal code. Among the complaints: \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
wheelchair users could enter without getting rained on, passing the sporting-goods store, or asking a security guard to unlock a door.\
